			description: [
				"&9&lGTLAdditions「Vientiane Transcription Node」"
				""
				"&7▌ Function:"
				"&lIt is a redstone output component, and the redstone signal is output from the front of the node."
				"&lcan be installed in the following two machines:"
				""
				"&l• Catalytic selection array: At the beginning of each catalytic cycle, a redstone signal of 1-15 is output to indicate the catalyst grouping required for this round."
				""
				"&l• Chrono boost engine: After the structure is formed, open the node GUI to configure the minimum temperature, maximum temperature and inverted redstone mode. The node will calculate the redstone output based on the current engine temperature and the set interval."
				"&l- Normal mode: A redstone signal is emitted when the temperature is within the set range, and no signal is emitted when it is below the minimum value."
				"&l- Inverted mode: emit a redstone signal when the temperature is outside the set range (including below the minimum value)."
				"&l- Configurable temperature range: 48000K to 105000K."
				""
				"&7▌ Suggestions:"
				"&l&6The temperature configuration is only valid for the hypertime boost engine. There is no need to configure the temperature in the catalytic selection array."
			]
